back of backwalls of abutments, if present, otherwise end to
end of the bridge floor; but in no case less than the total clear
opening of the structure.
(Roadway Width) - The clear width measured at right angles
to the longitudinal centerline of the bridge between the
bottom or curbs or guard timbers or in the case of multiple
height of curbs, between the bottom of the lower risers.

